    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33390" root="فرج" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْرَجٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُرْجَةٌ</span>. [Hence] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْرَجُ الغَمِ</span> [<i>The
place of opening of the mouth</i>]. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شجر</span>.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفَارِجُ</span> [is its pl.; and] signifies <i>Places of exit,</i> or
<i>egress.</i> (TA.)

